5,1,1,talk,Asuka,,We need to verify if previous initiatives actually improved patient outcomes before spending more.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Toshio,,I am concerned about the physical capacity of our current infrastructure to handle new demands.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"History suggests that without clear ownership, these programs often collapse within eighteen months.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Yumi,,I just want to make sure the teams actually get the support they need to succeed.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Servas,,"We must ask what this money truly builds, and what it earns back for the community.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Benjamin, do you have specific data on the failure rates of past projects?","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Asuka, I am looking at the logistics. Can we even fit the new workflow?","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Asuka, I am reviewing the structural dependencies. It is rarely about intent, but about maintenance.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Yumi,,"@Toshio, that sounds stressful. I hope the staff aren't already stretched too thin.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Servas,,"@Benjamin, I agree. The ledger often hides the true cost of keeping things running.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Asuka,,I will check the readmission figures to see if the call-back trial worked.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Toshio,,I need to see the booking system records and the room coverage details.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,I will look into the board minutes and the data agreements with outside surgeries.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Yumi,,I want to see the ward nursing vacancies and the therapy staffing review.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Servas,,I will examine the development allocation in the ledger and the regional fund tariffs.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Asuka,,Let us see what the numbers say before we commit to anything new.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Toshio,,"If the screens are full, nothing else matters. I will check the capacity.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,I am curious to see who actually signed off on the last joint venture.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Yumi,,I really hope the rosters show some breathing room for the new program.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Servas,,"I will trace the money to see where it actually goes, not just where it is promised.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
